COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.TARGET_AMT IS '이행대상액';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.FULFILLED_AMT IS '이행액';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.OBLIG_STS IS '상태 - CODE:OBLIG_STATUS (일배치 갱신)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.NEXT_ALERT_DT IS '다음 알림일';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.FOLLOWUP_CNT IS '독촉횟수';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.LAST_FOLLOWUP_DT IS '최종독촉일';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.FULFILLED_DT IS '이행일';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.REG_USER_ID IS '등록자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.REG_TS IS '등록일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.UPD_USER_ID IS '수정자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_OBLIGATION.UPD_TS IS '수정일시';
