COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.ALL_IN_RATE IS '적용금리';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.DAYCOUNT IS '일수계산';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.PREF_YN IS '우대 적용 - R-IO-14 판정 결과';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.PREF_DEAL_REF IS '우대 근거 거래 - TB_MM_DEAL_REF.DEAL_REF';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.PREF_CHECK_JSON IS '우대 판정 내역 - 조회기간·후보 거래·탈락 사유 스냅샷';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.INT_AMT IS '만기 이자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.INT_PAY_CYCLE IS '이자 지급 - MAT만기/MON월';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.MT320_MSG_ID IS 'MT320 확인';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.ROLLOVER_OF IS '연장 원거래 - 연장 시 새 거래로 등록, 우대 재판정';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.FUND_STS IS '상태 - BOOK/LIVE/MATD/RLVR/CXL';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.REG_USER_ID IS '등록자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.REG_TS IS '등록일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_FUNDING.UPD_USER_ID IS '수정자';
